Desktop host declaration fragments captured at Sailry Rust revision
eaad1b7f18e448c8c4e9e9286e19560c8a351ae1 and preserved in this repository.

api.d.ts and activity.d.ts extend sailry/sdk.
controls.d.ts, charts.d.ts, table.d.ts, tree.d.ts, notifications.d.ts,
layout.d.ts, activity-ui.d.ts, browser.d.ts, panes.d.ts, overlay.d.ts, menu.d.ts
and picker.d.ts extend sailry/ui.
forms.d.ts and configuration.d.ts extend sailry/forms.
sailry.d.ts declares sailry. The other fragments declare the corresponding
sailry module. Combined inline fragments retain their source declarations and
comments with indentation normalized.
These are source declarations; application runtime imports no external checkout.

Additions made in this repository, absent from that revision: in layout.d.ts
the SettingsRow `description`, `icon` and `wide` props and the SettingsGroup
`sortable`, `sort_label` and `sort_disabled` props; in menu.d.ts the Menu
`show_label` prop and its icon-button rule; in controls.d.ts the reorder value
of nextControlEvent.
